 s of all ages on a journey to become "official magicians" during this fast
 -paced\, comedy magic show for the entire family.\nSpace is limited. Ticke
 ts will be given out 30 minutes prior from the main desk at Swansea Memor
 ial branch.\nWith thanks to the Swansea Town Hall for funding this special
  event and providing the room.
