UID:69fa25931773192800179311@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join outdoor educator and musician Pete Moss for interactive s
 ongs and stories about Toronto plants\, birds\, wildlife\, and weather. L
 earn local bird calls\, how to identify common plants\, recognize animal t
 racks\, move like local creatures and celebrate nature in our communities.
 \nFor children of all ages with their parents or caregivers. Drop-in\, no 
 registration required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
