BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Asian Heritage Month Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260530T111500
UID:69f0c326bd5c392c76470fa4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special storytime program to celebrate Asian He
 ritage Month. This interactive session features captivating stories and t
 ales from Asia\, followed by hands-on origami craft where kids can creat
 e paper cranes\, flowers\, or lanterns.\nAll ages are welcome.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Lower level program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f0c326bd5c392c76470fa4
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:EarlyON Music and Movement
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260601T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260601T123000
UID:6a0495b2278f7c2f008ce2e1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and join EarlyON each Wednesday from May 25th to June
  15th\, for a Music & Movement program for families with children ages bir
 th to 6 years old. Enjoy songs\, stories\, finger rhymes\, socialize and m
 ore.
LOCATION:Port Union\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0495b2278f7c2f008ce2e1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Music and Movement
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260529T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260529T113000
UID:69d7fd6d4dacf581ff87afb6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Participants learn fundamental skills in note-reading\, pitch\
 , dance\, singing\, and Orff/Kodaly percussion techniques\, as well as soc
 ial skills like sharing\, focus\, teamwork\, and listening. Participants s
 ing\, play\, pitched and unpitched percussion instruments\, learn music th
 eory and notation\, and build confidence together to develop a strong musi
 cal foundation. Music and Movement classes will be led by a Sistema Toront
 o Teaching Artist.\nDrop In\n.\nNo Registration Required. For Children Ag
 es 2-5\, along with parent(s)/caregiver(s).
LOCATION:Downsview\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d7fd6d4dacf581ff87afb6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
